{"id":"briar-s-contempt-adept","name":"Briar's Contempt (Adept)","type":"Linear Fusion Rifle","tier":"Legendary","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7eb3bab7f1ef21d75bc6f1f32fa68fbe.jpg","screenshot":"/common/destiny2_content/screenshots/2890082420.jpg","columns":[{"label":"Barrel","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Arrowhead Brake","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f7fb54687aa52a9c2595d90ce9c9417.png","desc":"Lightly vented barrel.\n  •  Greatly controls recoil\n  •  Increases handling speed"},{"name":"Chambered Compensator","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0b451cbccc7f11f6aec9c153e59474cb.png","desc":"Stable barrel attachment.\n  •  Increases stability\n  •  Moderately controls recoil\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Corkscrew Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7730e1732ed7ef91afce50277639c493.png","desc":"Balanced barrel. \n  •  Slightly increases range and stability\n  •  Slightly increases handling speed"},{"name":"Extended Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9e5e8fa07a84c29252b78b0e7b3106d.png","desc":"Weighty barrel extension.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Decreases handling speed\n  •  Moderately controls recoil"},{"name":"Fluted Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/260eba9dd149dbb94b1306c9ed4dd8db.png","desc":"Ultra-light barrel. \n  •  Greatly increases handling speed\n  •  Slightly increases stability"},{"name":"Full Bore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40a4bdcf0f5a4e492927f9569eaf529d.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for distance.\n  •  Greatly increases range\n  •  Decreases stability\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Hammer-Forged Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/2b9eb6d4489cffc18c10223279198bcc.png","desc":"Durable ranged barrel.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Polygonal Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d7aaccee29cf450d4057a9de871cdc8.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for recoil reduction.\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Smallbore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d1bb6a623f14959a47156ee71acfc3a.png","desc":"Dual strength barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Full Choke","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/629246e67fc8690d56b5478b0262131a.png","desc":"Tightened barrel. Reduces projectile spread when aiming down sights at the cost of precision damage."},{"name":"Rifled Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/79d5f1f469d3290cfb849f4b3e6fc16b.png","desc":"Ranged shotgun barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Greatly decreases handling speed"}]},{"label":"Battery","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Accelerated Coils","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a51d91da9fb0a4c8f45b2ffa89e51ad7.png","desc":"Speeds up charge.\n  •  Faster charge time\n  •  Decreases impact damage"},{"name":"Enhanced Battery","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0ee59b61e99c52c85c2ea18ab705f700.png","desc":"Strong battery life.\n  •  Increases magazine size"},{"name":"Ionized Battery","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a278b79aba1d341d2a070c0e48d9129a.png","desc":"Large heavy battery.\n  •  Greatly increases magazine size\n  •  Greatly decreases reload speed"},{"name":"Liquid Coils","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/01e813d983526b009b4e1c700a1d0081.png","desc":"Slower-building charge for higher damage.\n  •  Increases impact damage\n  •  Slower charge time"},{"name":"Particle Repeater","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8a273117023794757631a34803314351.png","desc":"Improves stability. \n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Projection Fuse","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/eaa6fcec699a88e768782068d5e509e1.png","desc":"Distance optimizations.\n  •  Increases range"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Keep Away","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/597cd0f1c5fe1f7681a1c129f8b958dd.png","desc":"Increases reload, range, and accuracy when no targets are in close proximity."},{"name":"Envious Assassin","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bf7fccf6de8ee6d2e9e6285c004a4758.png","desc":"Defeating targets with other weapons before drawing this one transfers ammo to the magazine from reserves. This effect can overflow the magazine based on the number of targets defeated."},{"name":"Slideshot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d41765e3db3a77da5cce27888c52d87.png","desc":"Sliding partially reloads this weapon's magazine and temporarily boosts range and stability."},{"name":"Incandescent","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/22ed4a2cd5a0eb129a14ce77db49373f.png","desc":"Defeating a target spreads scorch to those nearby.\nMore powerful combatants and opposing Guardians cause scorch in a larger radius."},{"name":"Rewind Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a201fd61905b802867b677cf927e6e04.png","desc":"When this weapon's magazine is empty, it refills from reserves based on the number of hits."},{"name":"Demolitionist","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/da009697110e06b65d6f827b3b6d5f70.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate grenade energy. Activating your grenade ability reloads this weapon from reserves."},{"name":"Reconstruction","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9b0c09a784bc7af2f7d038e3626832a9.png","desc":"This weapon slowly reloads itself over time, up to double capacity."},{"name":"Burning Ambition","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f7a2484668486f64020a612bd3dd5ab9.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage scorches the target. Dealing damage to a scorched target inflicts scorch."},{"name":"Rapid Hit","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/de22847fa94634a487758041887bcdaa.png","desc":"Rapid precision hits temporarily increase stability and reload speed."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/23e06f4ced1b3e6476f342978ff5bb37.png","desc":"Being in combat for an extended time increases damage, handling, and reload for this weapon until you are out of combat."},{"name":"Surrounded","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/979881b68ca7839267c9aef5aea2b0ce.png","desc":"This weapon gains bonus damage when three or more enemies are in close proximity."},{"name":"Harmony","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a3c1c5e1cb05adef7cf6af6602a0da0.png","desc":"Final blows with other weapons improve this weapon's damage and performance for a short duration."},{"name":"Adagio","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b344c34bf750a840b24ff5d2f8fe4507.png","desc":"After defeating a target, this weapon fires, charges, or draws more slowly and deals increased damage for a brief time."},{"name":"High-Impact Reserves","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/33ed859a08f2ccf643a1ac3c7f201966.png","desc":"Rounds at the end of the magazine deal more damage."},{"name":"Paracausal Affinity","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6cdbccd2dc6395b60163984481b334eb.png","desc":"Final blows of energy types matching this weapon's alignment grant increased damage for a short period of time. Light final blows boost Arc, Solar, and Void weapons. Darkness final blows boost Stasis and Strand weapons."},{"name":"Focused Fury","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/15fb47018719c99ae37d10f794bc957e.png","desc":"Dealing a portion of the magazine as precision damage grants this weapon bonus damage. The shot count is reset whenever the weapon is reloaded or stowed."},{"name":"Aggregate Charge","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/35b9761aa61c2180059b9ba349c04dcf.png","desc":"This weapon deals more damage for each elemental debuff applied to the target."},{"name":"Chaos Reshaped","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9570c12a7c71062dd668f519c977fc22.png","desc":"This weapon gains bonus damage while in combat for an extended time. Remaining in combat for even longer rewards a larger damage bonus and periodically heals the wielder."}]}],"modes":{"all":{"rolls":[[0,12,21,32],[0,12,23,32],[4,12,21,32],[4,12,23,32],[0,11,18,32],[0,11,21,32],[0,11,23,32],[0,12,18,32],[0,12,21,26],[0,12,23,26],[0,13,18,32],[0,13,21,32],[0,13,23,32],[1,12,21,32],[1,12,23,3